  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The pattern followed here is: \n\n**Logic: Addition of +249 in each number.**\n\n**Given:**\n\n(413, 662, 911)\n\n⇒ 413 + 249 = 662\n\n⇒ 662 + 249 = 911\n\nAnd,\n\n(387, 636, 885)\n\n⇒ 387 + 249 = 636\n\n⇒ 636 + 249 = 885\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n1) (287, 536, 785)\n\n⇒ 287 + 249 = 536\n\n⇒ 536 + 249 = 785. (Correct)\n\n2) (403, 652, 907)\n\n⇒ 403 + 249 = 652\n\n⇒ 652 + 249 = 901 ≠ 907. (Incorrect)\n\n3) (521, 770, 1009)\n\n⇒ 521 + 249 = 770\n\n⇒ 770 + 249 = 1019 ≠ 1009. (Incorrect)\n\n4) (311, 560, 799)\n\n⇒ 311 + 249 = 560\n\n⇒ 560 + 249 = 809 ≠ 799. (Incorrect)\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"(287, 536, 785)\".**",
